=== W3.1: E1 50/50 SPLIT INCENTIVES FOR ALL 4 PARTICIPANT TYPES ===
Type 1 (Honest Seller, w=A):   Honest = +1.090V (0.99V + 0.10V dep) | E1 = +0.550V (0.50V + 0.05V dep) => Gain = -0.540V
Type 2 (Honest Buyer, w=B):    Honest = +1.100V (V + 0.05V pen + 0.05V D) | E1 = +0.450V (0.50V - 0.05V D) => Gain = -0.650V
Type 3 (Dishonest Buyer, w=A): Honest = -1.050V (keeps goods) | E1 = -0.550V (keeps goods + 0.50V refund) => Gross Stalling Gain = +0.500V
Type 4 (Dishonest Seller,w=B): Honest =  0.000V (loses 0.10V dep) | E1 = +0.550V (0.50V + 0.05V dep) => Gross Stalling Gain = +0.550V
  (Even if seller forfeits 100% of seller_deposit in E1, Dishonest Seller still gains +0.500V from 50/50 split!)

